      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(2) The head of the agency awarding the contract shall, at the time the contract is transmitted to the Comptroller for registration, certify that such contract is based upon specifications which comply with the above provisions. All open market orders issued shall contain a certificate by the head of the agency issuing the orders that such order is based upon specifications which comply with the above provisions.",
